{
  "$comment": [
    "Known-answer media corpus specification (design/testing/KNOWN-ANSWER-E2E.md).",
    "This file is the durable artifact: `python3 scripts/generate_known_corpus.py` recreates",
    "every audio file, artwork file, and the expected-outcome oracle from it, so the whole",
    "end-to-end exercise can be re-run at any time without committing binaries.",
    "Everything here is synthesised with ffmpeg from sine tones. No copyrighted audio.",
    "Durations are seconds; the generator records the exact duration ffprobe reports back into",
    "the oracle so assertions compare against the real artefact, not an assumption."
